{"term":{"label":"智","occurrences":4,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"6A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i","title":"告子上","description":"告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"內","id":"內"},{"form":"外","id":"外"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"小","id":"小"},{"form":"弗","id":"弗"},{"form":"從","id":"從"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"思","id":"思"},{"form":"或","id":"或"},{"form":"智","id":"智"},{"form":"由","id":"由"},{"form":"相","id":"相"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"舍","id":"舍"},{"form":"體","id":"體"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.9506607518139112,"source":"相","target":"或"},{"weight":1.7788104948872518,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.7275172004997015,"source":"仁","target":"內"},{"weight":1.2575135712539658,"source":"仁","target":"外"},{"weight":0.5643663906940205,"source":"仁","target":"心"},{"weight":1.2575135712539658,"source":"仁","target":"智"},{"weight":1.034370019939756,"source":"仁","target":"由"},{"weight":3.1182659119689724,"source":"思","target":"弗"},{"weight":0.7875099420082302,"source":"思","target":"心"},{"weight":1.4265899012978998,"source":"外","target":"義"},{"weight":1.6629786793621302,"source":"外","target":"內"},{"weight":1.3265064427409172,"source":"外","target":"從"},{"weight":1.8861222306763399,"source":"外","target":"智"},{"weight":1.6629786793621302,"source":"外","target":"由"},{"weight":1.7965100719866527,"source":"從","target":"大"},{"weight":3.1828044331065435,"source":"從","target":"體"},{"weight":2.0196536233008624,"source":"從","target":"小"},{"weight":2.3073356957526436,"source":"從","target":"或"},{"weight":0.7875099420082302,"source":"智","target":"心"},{"weight":2.3561258599220753,"source":"智","target":"由"},{"weight":1.0211247931897354,"source":"智","target":"義"},{"weight":2.173804303128121,"source":"智","target":"或"},{"weight":2.0196536233008624,"sour